    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan still holds four captives near the end of Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, Wu Hao is the only rank seven among them; the other three are the wood path Hua Hai immortals. Fang Yuan keeps him while using the three Hua Hai immortals in a bid plan around the Red Fiend Divine Boat recipe.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
